text: 'no. search availability for 24th july'

Outcome
  status: 'succeeded'
  stage: None
  action: 'SEARCH_AVAILABILITY'
  intent: 'CREATE_APPOINTMENT'

Why
  - Turn completed with an execution artifact
  - Confirmation gate is open for this durable booking flow
